    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i hear you on the doctor thing, but it's just so hard to manage this on my own. what kind of alternative stuff do you mean? like, is there something else i can take right now that's safe for my kidneys but will actually stop the cramping so i can sleep? i really need something that works tonight.",
